{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multiprofile RNA-only model using the scgpt encoder with transformer aggregation, comparing it to the previously successful scvi_n200 encoder. Validation accuracy of 0.514 (vs. 0.653 for scvi_n200 with transformer aggregation) and F1 of 0.498 suggest scgpt underperforms in this setup. The exact impact of encoder architecture remains uncertain, as other factors like fusion strategies were not evaluated."
}

